      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yeah, it's worse with cold weather. It's all the time. I'd give it a four, out of ten.",
