        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Breathlessness on exertion goes along with it, most of the time. The Breathlessness on exertion? That's been for five days. As for pain in my jaw, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before.",
